{
  "Version": 2,
  "ProgramText": "; Synth demo: four channels in C64 style\nPLAY BPM 140\n\n; Channel 1: melody with pulse width modulation and vibrato\nPLAY WAVE 1, \"Pulse\"\nPLAY PULSE 1, 30, 15, 1.5\nPLAY ADSR 1, 5, 120, 70, 150\nPLAY VIBRATO 1, 20, 5\nPLAY GLIDE 1, 25\nPLAY VOLUME 1, 0.25\n\n; Channel 2: bass with a filter envelope, a \"wah\" on every note\nPLAY WAVE 2, \"Sawtooth\"\nPLAY ADSR 2, 2, 0, 100, 60\nPLAY FILTER 2, \"LOW\", 150, 65\nPLAY FILTERENV 2, 2500, 2, 180\nPLAY VOLUME 2, 0.28\n\n; Channel 3: chords as a fast arpeggio\nPLAY WAVE 3, \"Pulse\"\nPLAY PULSE 3, 25\nPLAY ARP 3, \"0 7 12\", 50\nPLAY ADSR 3, 10, 300, 40, 200\nPLAY VOLUME 3, 0.12\n\n; Channel 4: drums\nPLAY WAVE 4, \"Drums\"\nPLAY VOLUME 4, 0.3\n\nM1$ = \"E5:8 A5 C6 B5 A5:4 E5 F5:8 A5 C6 A5 G5:4 F5 E5:8 G5 C6 D6 E6:4 D6:8 C6\"\nMELODY$ = M1$ & \" B5:4. A5:8 G5:2 \" & M1$ & \" B5:4 G5 A5:2\"\nBASS$ = \"A2:8 A2 A3 A2 A2 A3 A2 A3 F2 F2 F3 F2 F2 F3 F2 F3 C3 C3 C4 C3 C3 C4 C3 C4 G2 G2 G3 G2 G2 G3 G2 G3\"\n\nPLAY MUSIC 1, MELODY$\nPLAY MUSIC 2, BASS$ & \" \" & BASS$\nPLAY MUSIC 3, \"A4:1 F4 C5 G4 A4 F4 C5 G4\"\nPLAY LOOP 4, \"BD:8 HH SD HH BD BD SD HH\"\n\nPRINT \"Playing... the bass filter slowly opens during the song\"\n\n; Raise the bass filter cutoff while the music plays\nF = 150\nWHILE PLAYING(1)\n  F = F + 1\n  PLAY FILTER 2, \"LOW\", F, 65\n  WAIT VBL\nWEND\n\nPLAY STOP\nPRINT \"Done!\"\n",
  "ScreenWidth": null,
  "ScreenHeight": null,
